  << /ActualText (The guiding force for the project has been gathering as many details we could about available games\054 customer interest in a new product combining pool betting and soccer \050there was nothing similar in 2017 in the market\051\056 The final step we decided to do\054 a guerrilla survey in a horse racing track\054 gave us the final tips to get a real understanding of the feasibility and build the rules for our new game\056)
